@startuml 16-payment-sequence
!include _style.iuml
title Paying for a booking: three entry points, one processor
autonumber

actor Guest
participant "PaymentController" as PC
participant "PaymentServiceImpl" as PS
participant "BookingPayments\n(booking implements)" as BP
participant "PaymentGateway\nRazorpay or Mock" as GW
participant "Razorpay" as RZ
participant "RazorpayPaymentController\n+ RazorpayCheckoutService" as VC
participant "RazorpayWebhookController" as WC
participant "PaymentReconciler\n(every 2 min)" as REC
participant "PaymentEventProcessor" as PEP
database "payments,\npayment_events" as DB

== 1. Start (no DB transaction open during the provider call) ==
Guest -> PC : POST /api/v5/bookings/{id}/pay
PC -> PS : startPayment(guestId, bookingId)
PS -> BP : getPayableBooking
BP --> PS : reference, amount, currency, holdExpiresAt\n(409 if paid, expired or cancelled)
PS -> DB : open CREATED payment for this booking?
alt reuse it
else none
  PS -> GW : createOrder(reference, amount, currency)
  GW -> RZ : create order (paise)
  PS -> DB : insert payment CREATED
end
PS --> Guest : orderId, amount, currency, publicKey, mock

== 2a. Browser path (fast) ==
Guest -> RZ : checkout popup (card never touches our server)
RZ --> Guest : paymentId + signature
Guest -> VC : POST /api/v5/payments/razorpay/{orderId}/verify
VC -> VC : payment belongs to this guest?\nHMAC(orderId|paymentId, keySecret) ok? (else 400)
VC -> PEP : PAYMENT_SUCCEEDED, eventId verify_{paymentId},\nour stored amount

== 2b. Server path (source of truth) ==
RZ -> WC : POST /api/v5/payments/webhook/razorpay\nraw body + X-Razorpay-Signature
WC -> WC : HMAC of raw bytes (else 401, nothing parsed)
WC -> PEP : payment.captured -> SUCCEEDED\npayment.failed -> FAILED\n(other events: 200 ignored)

== 2c. Safety net ==
REC -> GW : CREATED payments 5 to 120 min old:\nfindCapturedPayment(orderId)
REC -> PEP : captured -> eventId reconcile_{paymentId}

== 3. One set of rules ==
PEP -> DB : lock payment row,\nskip an eventId already stored
PEP -> BP : confirmPayment(bookingId, paymentId, amount, currency)
BP --> PEP : CONFIRMED / ALREADY_CONFIRMED /\nDUPLICATE / UNAVAILABLE / MISMATCH
PEP -> DB : update payment status\n(and REFUND_PENDING for DUPLICATE / UNAVAILABLE)
note over PEP
  BookingConfirmedEvent goes out after commit:
  bell + email for guest and host,
  and an earnings ledger entry.
end note
@enduml
